"This is a Skedar warrior lurking within a holographic projection of a striking blonde young human male in his late 20's.  The oral modulation unit gives the Skedar a precise, persuasive, and intelligent voice. It is a propaganda and manipulation tool for the Skedar, and an unusually subtle one.\n"
