#. L_DISH_219
msgid ""
"The Institute building comprises many different areas: offices and "
"laboratories, workshops and hangars. It is quite isolated from the outside "
"world, which helps keep the operations covert.\n"
msgstr ""
"The Institute building comprises many different areas: offices and "
"laboratories, workshops and hangars. It is quite isolated from the outside "
"world, which helps keep the operations covert.\n"

#. L_DISH_220
msgid ""
"In the midst of the business district, the austere skyscraper of the "
"dataDyne Corporation stands out from the surroundings.\n"
msgstr ""
"In the midst of the business district, the austere skyscraper of the "
"dataDyne Corporation stands out from the surroundings.\n"

#. L_DISH_221
msgid ""
"These heavily guarded, well-hidden labs hold the key to dataDyne's future. "
"Within them, techs work on top-secret projects aimed at putting dataDyne on "
"the top of the heap.\n"
msgstr ""
"These heavily guarded, well-hidden labs hold the key to dataDyne's future. "
"Within them, techs work on top-secret projects aimed at putting dataDyne on "
"the top of the heap.\n"

#. L_DISH_222
msgid ""
"Owned by the Institute, this secluded residence is used by Daniel Carrington"
" as a retreat from the pressures of the Institute. As well as an "
"observatory, it has a power generator and an extensive wine cellar.\n"
msgstr ""
"Owned by the Institute, this secluded residence is used by Daniel Carrington"
" as a retreat from the pressures of the Institute. As well as an "
"observatory, it has a power generator and an extensive wine cellar.\n"

#. L_DISH_223
msgid ""
"A seedy, grimy part of the city of Chicago, now closed to ground traffic. It"
" is here that the G5 Corporation has its headquarters.\n"
msgstr ""
"A seedy, grimy part of the city of Chicago, now closed to ground traffic. It"
" is here that the G5 Corporation has its headquarters.\n"

#. L_DISH_224
msgid ""
"Inside the G5 Building is a meeting room protected by anti-recording "
"safeguards. This is the safest place for dataDyne to formulate confidential "
"plans.\n"
msgstr ""
"Inside the G5 Building is a meeting room protected by anti-recording "
"safeguards. This is the safest place for dataDyne to formulate confidential "
"plans.\n"

#. L_DISH_225
msgid ""
"This section of the extensive facility known as Area 51 is based in the "
"foothills around Groom Dry Lake. Exterior helipads and communication towers "
"hint at the size of the complex beneath ground level.\n"
msgstr ""
"This section of the extensive facility known as Area 51 is based in the "
"foothills around Groom Dry Lake. Exterior helipads and communication towers "
"hint at the size of the complex beneath ground level.\n"

#. L_DISH_226
msgid ""
"One of a series of reinforced air bases available as staging posts for Air "
"Force One. Typically, the air base is remote, in an inhospitable region, far"
" away from prying eyes.\n"
msgstr ""
"One of a series of reinforced air bases available as staging posts for Air "
"Force One. Typically, the air base is remote, in an inhospitable region, far"
" away from prying eyes.\n"

#. L_DISH_227
msgid ""
"This particular Air Force One is optimized for cold climates, useful when it"
" is based in the north of Alaska. The flight destination is Oslo, Norway.\n"
msgstr ""
"This particular Air Force One is optimized for cold climates, useful when it"
" is based in the north of Alaska. The flight destination is Oslo, Norway.\n"

#. L_DISH_228
msgid ""
"In the rocky snow-covered landscape of the Arctic Circle, the wreckage of "
"the stricken plane has come to rest.\n"
msgstr ""
"In the rocky snow-covered landscape of the Arctic Circle, the wreckage of "
"the stricken plane has come to rest.\n"

#. L_DISH_229
msgid ""
"Owned by the U.S. government, the Pelagic II is capable of staging deep-sea "
"diving operations in all weather conditions. It is the only fully integrated"
" ocean floor research vessel in the world.\n"
msgstr ""
"Owned by the U.S. government, the Pelagic II is capable of staging deep-sea "
"diving operations in all weather conditions. It is the only fully integrated"
" ocean floor research vessel in the world.\n"

#. L_DISH_230
msgid ""
"A huge ship of alien construction that has lain on the ocean floor for "
"millions of years.\n"
msgstr ""
"A huge ship of alien construction that has lain on the ocean floor for "
"millions of years.\n"

#. L_DISH_231
msgid ""
"An interplanetary assault ship that carries Skedar warriors to their war "
"zones. Part of the much-reduced Skedar battle fleet.\n"
msgstr ""
"An interplanetary assault ship that carries Skedar warriors to their war "
"zones. Part of the much-reduced Skedar battle fleet.\n"

#. L_DISH_232
msgid ""
"A highly arid planet, racked by earthquakes, sandstorms, and hurricanes. It "
"is part of a complex solar system that includes three suns.\n"
msgstr ""
"A highly arid planet, racked by earthquakes, sandstorms, and hurricanes. It "
"is part of a complex solar system that includes three suns.\n"

#. L_DISH_233
msgid ""
"A small, fast, highly maneuverable agent-deployment craft designed for use "
"in urban areas. Can be either computer controlled or remote piloted. It has "
"enough room inside for three to four agents, plus equipment.\n"
msgstr ""
"A small, fast, highly maneuverable agent-deployment craft designed for use "
"in urban areas. Can be either computer controlled or remote piloted. It has "
"enough room inside for three to four agents, plus equipment.\n"

#. L_DISH_234
msgid ""
"An antigrav device designed to aid warehouse workers. It is attached to the "
"side of a crate. When activated, the AG field lifts the crate and removes "
"some of the inertia.\n"
msgstr ""
"An antigrav device designed to aid warehouse workers. It is attached to the "
"side of a crate. When activated, the AG field lifts the crate and removes "
"some of the inertia.\n"

#. L_DISH_235
msgid ""
"A low-altitude patrol bike. Uses a small AG unit to hover, then a small but "
"powerful turbine with vectored thrust to move and provide directional "
"control.\n"
msgstr ""
"A low-altitude patrol bike. Uses a small AG unit to hover, then a small but "
"powerful turbine with vectored thrust to move and provide directional "
"control.\n"

#. L_DISH_236
msgid ""
"Keeps the place clean and tidy. Tends to have access to all areas of a "
"building - agents are advised to leave such robots intact where possible, as"
" they can unwittingly provide a means of ingress to sensitive zones.\n"
msgstr ""
"Keeps the place clean and tidy. Tends to have access to all areas of a "
"building - agents are advised to leave such robots intact where possible, as"
" they can unwittingly provide a means of ingress to sensitive zones.\n"

#. L_DISH_237
msgid ""
"An urban patrol and suppression vehicle. Two-man crew, armed with a vulcan "
"cannon on the nose pod, and two wingtip-mounted dumbfire missile pods. Can "
"be taken out with sustained gunfire or, preferably, one well-aimed rocket.\n"
msgstr ""
"An urban patrol and suppression vehicle. Two-man crew, armed with a vulcan "
"cannon on the nose pod, and two wingtip-mounted dumbfire missile pods. Can "
"be taken out with sustained gunfire or, preferably, one well-aimed rocket.\n"

#. L_DISH_238
msgid ""
"A combat robot designed for urban warfare. Uses an antigrav unit to hover; "
"heavily armed and shielded. Often used to keep out unwanted visitors, due to"
" the 'shoot first and don't ask questions later' programming.\n"
msgstr ""
"A combat robot designed for urban warfare. Uses an antigrav unit to hover; "
"heavily armed and shielded. Often used to keep out unwanted visitors, due to"
" the 'shoot first and don't ask questions later' programming.\n"

#. L_DISH_239
msgid ""
"A robotic variant of the HoverBike, with more powerful AG and turbine units;"
" it can reach Mach 2 with ease and yet can cruise for hours at walking pace."
" Although quite well armed, it relies on maneuverability rather than "
"shielding.\n"
msgstr ""
"A robotic variant of the HoverBike, with more powerful AG and turbine units;"
" it can reach Mach 2 with ease and yet can cruise for hours at walking pace."
" Although quite well armed, it relies on maneuverability rather than "
"shielding.\n"

#. L_DISH_240
msgid ""
"Designed to carry a single Maian pilot.  A passenger would find themselves "
"cramped - a human passenger even more so.\n"
msgstr ""
"Designed to carry a single Maian pilot.  A passenger would find themselves "
"cramped - a human passenger even more so.\n"

#. L_DISH_241
msgid ""
"Capable of carrying ten fully armed and armored Skedar warriors to battle. "
"Undetectable by conventional radar. It can broadcast powerful jamming waves "
"over a considerable area - these disrupt communications as well as detection"
" equipment.\n"
msgstr ""
"Capable of carrying ten fully armed and armored Skedar warriors to battle. "
"Undetectable by conventional radar. It can broadcast powerful jamming waves "
"over a considerable area - these disrupt communications as well as detection"
" equipment.\n"

#. L_DISH_242
msgid ""
"Description\n"
"- A good agent notices everything around him or her.\n"
"\n"
"Training Instructions\n"
"- Examine all of the objects by looking directly at them.\n"
"\n"
"Operation\n"
"-Look up- Press the Down C Button\n"
"-Look down- Press the Up C Button\n"
"-Free Look- Hold down the R Button to enter Aim mode, and use the Control Stick to look.\n"
msgstr ""
"Description\n"
"- A good agent notices everything around him or her.\n"
"\n"
"Training Instructions\n"
"- Examine all of the objects by looking directly at them.\n"
"\n"
"Operation\n"
"-Look up- Press the Down C Button\n"
"-Look down- Press the Up C Button\n"
"-Free Look- Hold down the R Button to enter Aim mode, and use the Control Stick to look.\n"

#. L_DISH_243
msgid ""
"Description\n"
"- Sidestepping and strafing can get you out of trouble.\n"
"\n"
"Training Instructions\n"
"- Activate all of the switches in front. Be quick, though, as each switch will reset on a time limit.\n"
"\n"
"Operation\n"
"- Sidestep left- Left C Button\n"
"- Sidestep right- Right C Button\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Description\n"
"- Sidestepping and strafing can get you out of trouble.\n"
"\n"
"Training Instructions\n"
"- Activate all of the switches in front. Be quick, though, as each switch will reset on a time limit.\n"
"\n"
"Operation\n"
"- Sidestep left- Left C Button\n"
"- Sidestep right- Right C Button\n"
"\n"

#. L_DISH_244
msgid ""
"Description\n"
"- Ducking and crouching can open up new areas for exploration.\n"
"\n"
"Training Instructions\n"
"- Work your way through the obstacles using the moves available to you. Activate the switches.\n"
"\n"
"Operation\n"
"- Duck- Hold the R Button, then press the Down C Button.\n"
"- Crouch- When ducking, hold the R Button, then press the Down C Button.\n"
"- Get up- Tap the R Button.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Description\n"
"- Ducking and crouching can open up new areas for exploration.\n"
"\n"
"Training Instructions\n"
"- Work your way through the obstacles using the moves available to you. Activate the switches.\n"
"\n"
"Operation\n"
"- Duck- Hold the R Button, then press the Down C Button.\n"
"- Crouch- When ducking, hold the R Button, then press the Down C Button.\n"
"- Get up- Tap the R Button.\n"
"\n"

#. L_DISH_245
msgid ""
"Description\n"
"- Fighting multiple opponents in hand-to-hand combat can be difficult.\n"
"\n"
"Training Instructions\n"
"- Knock out all enemies without getting hit.\n"
"\n"
"Operation\n"
"- Punch - Press the Z Button repeatedly when unarmed to launch a flurry of punches.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Description\n"
"- Fighting multiple opponents in hand-to-hand combat can be difficult.\n"
"\n"
"Training Instructions\n"
"- Knock out all enemies without getting hit.\n"
"\n"
"Operation\n"
"- Punch - Press the Z Button repeatedly when unarmed to launch a flurry of punches.\n"
"\n"

#. L_DISH_246
msgid ""
"Description\n"
"- Disarming an enemy can get you a new weapon.\n"
"\n"
"Training Instructions\n"
"- Knock out/disarm all enemies without getting hit.\n"
"\n"
"Operation\n"
"- Disarm - Hold the B Button, then press the Z Button to disarm an enemy.\n"
"- Knockout Punch - Punch an unaware enemy from behind.\n"
msgstr ""
"Description\n"
"- Disarming an enemy can get you a new weapon.\n"
"\n"
"Training Instructions\n"
"- Knock out/disarm all enemies without getting hit.\n"
"\n"
"Operation\n"
"- Disarm - Hold the B Button, then press the Z Button to disarm an enemy.\n"
"- Knockout Punch - Punch an unaware enemy from behind.\n"

#. L_DISH_247
msgid ""
"Description\n"
"- Fighting multiple opponents in hand-to-hand combat.\n"
"\n"
"Training Instructions\n"
"- Beat all the unarmed enemies without getting hit.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Description\n"
"- Fighting multiple opponents in hand-to-hand combat.\n"
"\n"
"Training Instructions\n"
"- Beat all the unarmed enemies without getting hit.\n"
"\n"

#. L_DISH_248
msgid ""
"Description\n"
"- Fighting multiple opponents, both armed and unarmed.\n"
"\n"
"Training Instructions\n"
"- Beat all the armed enemies without getting hit.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Description\n"
"- Fighting multiple opponents, both armed and unarmed.\n"
"\n"
"Training Instructions\n"
"- Beat all the armed enemies without getting hit.\n"
"\n"

#. L_DISH_249
msgid ""
"For greater precision and freedom when looking around, use the Aiming "
"mode.\n"
msgstr ""
"For greater precision and freedom when looking around, use the Aiming "
"mode.\n"

#. L_DISH_250
msgid ""
"Think about where you want to go before attempting the test. Set yourself up"
" in a place that will require the least amount of movement between "
"targets.\n"
msgstr ""
"Think about where you want to go before attempting the test. Set yourself up"
" in a place that will require the least amount of movement between "
"targets.\n"

#. L_DISH_251
msgid ""
"Ducking enables you to reach places normally inaccessible to you, but "
"remember that you move quickest when standing upright. To move through the "
"test as fast as possible, try ducking only when you have to.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ducking enables you to reach places normally inaccessible to you, but "
"remember that you move quickest when standing upright. To move through the "
"test as fast as possible, try ducking only when you have to.\n"

#. L_DISH_252
msgid ""
"Attacking opponents from behind may be dishonorable, but doing so makes it "
"easier to take them down. Only close to fighting distance when you have to, "
"and be prepared to step back out of range when they attack you.\n"
msgstr ""
"Attacking opponents from behind may be dishonorable, but doing so makes it "
"easier to take them down. Only close to fighting distance when you have to, "
"and be prepared to step back out of range when they attack you.\n"

#. L_DISH_253
msgid ""
"Only stay close long enough to grab the weapon. Back out of range of any "
"retribution and use your new weapon.\n"
msgstr ""
"Only stay close long enough to grab the weapon. Back out of range of any "
"retribution and use your new weapon.\n"

#. L_DISH_254
msgid ""
"Don't hang around and wait to get hit, move! Don't focus on one opponent; "
"try to be aware of where all of them are. If you can't see all of them, move"
" until you can.\n"
msgstr ""
"Don't hang around and wait to get hit, move! Don't focus on one opponent; "
"try to be aware of where all of them are. If you can't see all of them, move"
" until you can.\n"

#. L_DISH_255
msgid ""
"Go for the armed opponents once you are confident of your hand-to-hand "
"skills. Back away from the disarmed enemies and use their weapons on them "
"before they get too close to you.\n"
msgstr ""
"Go for the armed opponents once you are confident of your hand-to-hand "
"skills. Back away from the disarmed enemies and use their weapons on them "
"before they get too close to you.\n"

#. L_DISH_256
msgid ""
"For greater precision and freedom when looking around, use the Aiming "
"mode.\n"
msgstr ""
"For greater precision and freedom when looking around, use the Aiming "
"mode.\n"

#. L_DISH_257
msgid "Sidestepping and strafing can get you out of trouble.\n"
msgstr "Sidestepping and strafing can get you out of trouble.\n"

#. L_DISH_258
msgid ""
"Ducking enables you to reach places normally inaccessible to you, but "
"remember that you move quickest when standing upright. To move as fast as "
"possible, try ducking only when you have to.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ducking enables you to reach places normally inaccessible to you, but "
"remember that you move quickest when standing upright. To move as fast as "
"possible, try ducking only when you have to.\n"

#. L_DISH_259
msgid ""
"Attacking opponents from behind may be dishonorable, but doing so makes it "
"easier to take them down. Only close to fighting distance when you have to, "
"and be prepared to step back out of range when they attack you.\n"
msgstr ""
"Attacking opponents from behind may be dishonorable, but doing so makes it "
"easier to take them down. Only close to fighting distance when you have to, "
"and be prepared to step back out of range when they attack you.\n"

#. L_DISH_260
msgid ""
"Only stay close long enough to grab the weapon. Back out of range of any "
"retribution and use your new weapon.\n"
msgstr ""
"Only stay close long enough to grab the weapon. Back out of range of any "
"retribution and use your new weapon.\n"

#. L_DISH_261
msgid ""
"Don't hang around and wait to get hit; move! Don't focus on one opponent; "
"try to be aware of where all of them are. If you can't see all of them, move"
" until you can.\n"
msgstr ""
"Don't hang around and wait to get hit; move! Don't focus on one opponent; "
"try to be aware of where all of them are. If you can't see all of them, move"
" until you can.\n"

#. L_DISH_262
msgid ""
"Go for the armed opponents once you are confident of your hand-to-hand "
"skills. Back away from the disarmed enemies and use their weapons on them "
"before they get too close to you.\n"
msgstr ""
"Go for the armed opponents once you are confident of your hand-to-hand "
"skills. Back away from the disarmed enemies and use their weapons on them "
"before they get too close to you.\n"

#. L_DISH_263
msgid ""
"Always keep the target object in view when using the Data Uplink, and stay "
"close to prevent the connection from being severed.\n"
msgstr ""
"Always keep the target object in view when using the Data Uplink, and stay "
"close to prevent the connection from being severed.\n"

#. L_DISH_264
msgid ""
"Be sure the mine will land in the correct place by getting as close as you "
"can to the target. Adjust your aim using the C Buttons or the R Button "
"Aiming mode.\n"
msgstr ""
"Be sure the mine will land in the correct place by getting as close as you "
"can to the target. Adjust your aim using the C Buttons or the R Button "
"Aiming mode.\n"

#. L_DISH_265
msgid "The CamSpy can be difficult to control, so take your time.\n"
msgstr "The CamSpy can be difficult to control, so take your time.\n"

#. L_DISH_266
msgid "Useful in combat, but can cause problems when overloading.\n"
msgstr "Useful in combat, but can cause problems when overloading.\n"

#. L_DISH_267
msgid ""
"If you are having trouble attaching the Decoder, try standing closer to the "
"target and facing it.\n"
msgstr ""
"If you are having trouble attaching the Decoder, try standing closer to the "
"target and facing it.\n"

#. L_DISH_268
msgid ""
"The Tracker only indicates direction and relative height; it doesn't display"
" a map guiding you to the target. Pay attention to your surroundings, and be"
" prepared to explore.\n"
msgstr ""
"The Tracker only indicates direction and relative height; it doesn't display"
" a map guiding you to the target. Pay attention to your surroundings, and be"
" prepared to explore.\n"

#. L_DISH_269
msgid ""
"The visor narrows your peripheral vision, which can cause problems in "
"combat. Be sure of your situation before you use it.\n"
msgstr ""
"The visor narrows your peripheral vision, which can cause problems in "
"combat. Be sure of your situation before you use it.\n"

#. L_DISH_270
msgid ""
"If you use this device at the wrong time, it could cost you your life, since"
" it can prevent you from seeing anything beyond a certain distance. Use "
"sparingly.\n"
msgstr ""
"If you use this device at the wrong time, it could cost you your life, since"
" it can prevent you from seeing anything beyond a certain distance. Use "
"sparingly.\n"

#. L_DISH_271
msgid ""
"A disguise is not just the clothing, it is the manner of the person wearing "
"it. Don't behave out of character for the person you are trying to be.\n"
msgstr ""
"A disguise is not just the clothing, it is the manner of the person wearing "
"it. Don't behave out of character for the person you are trying to be.\n"

#. L_DISH_272
msgid ""
"Preserve the supply of the Cloaking Device when there is no one around to "
"observe you.\n"
msgstr ""
"Preserve the supply of the Cloaking Device when there is no one around to "
"observe you.\n"

#. L_DISH_273
msgid ""
"Always keep the target object in view when using the Data Uplink, and stay "
"close to prevent the connection from being severed.\n"
msgstr ""
"Always keep the target object in view when using the Data Uplink, and stay "
"close to prevent the connection from being severed.\n"

#. L_DISH_274
msgid ""
"Be sure the mine will land in the correct place by getting as close as you "
"can to the target. Adjust your aim using the C Buttons or the R Button "
"Aiming mode.\n"
msgstr ""
"Be sure the mine will land in the correct place by getting as close as you "
"can to the target. Adjust your aim using the C Buttons or the R Button "
"Aiming mode.\n"

#. L_DISH_275
msgid ""
"The CamSpy is not invisible - enemies may spot it - so be careful when "
"entering an inhabited area.  Remember that the CamSpy will remain where you "
"left it unless you pick it up.\n"
msgstr ""
"The CamSpy is not invisible - enemies may spot it - so be careful when "
"entering an inhabited area.  Remember that the CamSpy will remain where you "
"left it unless you pick it up.\n"

#. L_DISH_276
msgid ""
"Useful in combat, but can cause problems when overloading. Try to anticipate"
" such situations and react before the enemy.\n"
msgstr ""
"Useful in combat, but can cause problems when overloading. Try to anticipate"
" such situations and react before the enemy.\n"

#. L_DISH_277
msgid ""
"If you are having trouble attaching the Decoder, try standing closer to the "
"target and facing it.\n"
msgstr ""
"If you are having trouble attaching the Decoder, try standing closer to the "
"target and facing it.\n"

#. L_DISH_278
msgid ""
"The Tracker only indicates direction and relative height; it doesn't display"
" a map guiding you to the target. Pay attention to your surroundings, and be"
" prepared to explore.\n"
msgstr ""
"The Tracker only indicates direction and relative height; it doesn't display"
" a map guiding you to the target. Pay attention to your surroundings, and be"
" prepared to explore.\n"

#. L_DISH_279
msgid ""
"The visor narrows your peripheral vision, which can cause problems in "
"combat. Be sure of your situation before you use it.\n"
msgstr ""
"The visor narrows your peripheral vision, which can cause problems in "
"combat. Be sure of your situation before you use it.\n"

#. L_DISH_280
msgid ""
"If you use this device at the wrong time, it could cost you your life, since"
" it can prevent you from seeing anything beyond a certain distance. Use "
"sparingly.\n"
msgstr ""
"If you use this device at the wrong time, it could cost you your life, since"
" it can prevent you from seeing anything beyond a certain distance. Use "
"sparingly.\n"

#. L_DISH_281
msgid ""
"A disguise is not just the clothing, it is the manner of the person wearing "
"it. Don't behave out of character for the person you are trying to be.\n"
msgstr ""
"A disguise is not just the clothing, it is the manner of the person wearing "
"it. Don't behave out of character for the person you are trying to be.\n"

#. L_DISH_282
msgid ""
"Preserve the supply of the Cloaking Device when there is no one around to "
"observe you. Avoid firing unless absolutely necessary and until you are "
"assured of the success of your attack.\n"
msgstr ""
"Preserve the supply of the Cloaking Device when there is no one around to "
"observe you. Avoid firing unless absolutely necessary and until you are "
"assured of the success of your attack.\n"

#. L_DISH_283
msgid ""
"The Falcon 2 is a very accurate handgun, so any error in this test is your "
"own. The secondary mode is a pistol-whip and is, therefore, useless in a "
"firing range.\n"
msgstr ""
"The Falcon 2 is a very accurate handgun, so any error in this test is your "
"own. The secondary mode is a pistol-whip and is, therefore, useless in a "
"firing range.\n"

#. L_DISH_284
msgid ""
"To make better use of the accuracy of the Falcon 2, a scope has been "
"attached to the pistol. As with the unmodified Falcon 2, the pistol-whip "
"secondary mode is useless during the firing range test.\n"
msgstr ""
"To make better use of the accuracy of the Falcon 2, a scope has been "
"attached to the pistol. As with the unmodified Falcon 2, the pistol-whip "
"secondary mode is useless during the firing range test.\n"

#. L_DISH_285
msgid ""
"The silenced version of the Falcon 2 is an excellent stealth weapon, "
"designed to give you the advantage of surprise over your opponents. Test "
"your accuracy to ensure you never waste your chances.\n"
msgstr ""
"The silenced version of the Falcon 2 is an excellent stealth weapon, "
"designed to give you the advantage of surprise over your opponents. Test "
"your accuracy to ensure you never waste your chances.\n"

#. L_DISH_286
msgid ""
"The MagSec 4 has excellent shot power at the cost of accuracy, especially "
"when used in the 3-round burst secondary mode. The only serious drawback to "
"the weapon is a limited magazine size.\n"
msgstr ""
"The MagSec 4 has excellent shot power at the cost of accuracy, especially "
"when used in the 3-round burst secondary mode. The only serious drawback to "
"the weapon is a limited magazine size.\n"

#. L_DISH_287
msgid ""
"This is a typical Skedar weapon, brutal and powerful. By sacrificing some of"
" the magazine, the shot can be charged up to give a devastating blast. The "
"large ammo capacity is a bonus.\n"
msgstr ""
"This is a typical Skedar weapon, brutal and powerful. By sacrificing some of"
" the magazine, the shot can be charged up to give a devastating blast. The "
"large ammo capacity is a bonus.\n"

#. L_DISH_288
msgid ""
"This versatile pistol gives two different delivery systems for the rounds it"
" fires: a standard shot or an explosive round. Maian engineers managed to do"
" this without compromising the energy usage of the weapon, though the fire "
"rate is reduced.\n"
msgstr ""
"This versatile pistol gives two different delivery systems for the rounds it"
" fires: a standard shot or an explosive round. Maian engineers managed to do"
" this without compromising the energy usage of the weapon, though the fire "
"rate is reduced.\n"

#. L_DISH_289
msgid ""
"The key to the DY357 is in knowing when to reload. A six-round magazine "
"means that you must always be alert in a firefight. The weight of the "
"handgun can be useful if you have to club someone with it.\n"
msgstr ""
"The key to the DY357 is in knowing when to reload. A six-round magazine "
"means that you must always be alert in a firefight. The weight of the "
"handgun can be useful if you have to club someone with it.\n"

#. L_DISH_290
msgid ""
"Trent Easton is always looking for that extra edge, and this gun is no "
"exception. The bullets are as special as the rest of the gun; they are "
"designed to shatter inside opponents to take them down quickly.\n"
msgstr ""
"Trent Easton is always looking for that extra edge, and this gun is no "
"exception. The bullets are as special as the rest of the gun; they are "
"designed to shatter inside opponents to take them down quickly.\n"

#. L_DISH_291
msgid ""
"A reliable and effective submachine gun, it is not difficult to see why this"
" is the best-selling dataDyne weapon of the past two years even if the "
"secondary mode is not taken into account. The target designate and lock-on "
"system is excellent, and you should familiarize yourself with the complete "
"operation of the weapon.\n"
msgstr ""
"A reliable and effective submachine gun, it is not difficult to see why this"
" is the best-selling dataDyne weapon of the past two years even if the "
"secondary mode is not taken into account. The target designate and lock-on "
"system is excellent, and you should familiarize yourself with the complete "
"operation of the weapon.\n"

#. L_DISH_292
msgid ""
"The Cyclone submachine gun was specifically designed NOT to be accurate, "
"though it is worth your time practicing. It can put a lot of bullets out in "
"a short time, however, and is an excellent suppression weapon because of "
"it.\n"
msgstr ""
"The Cyclone submachine gun was specifically designed NOT to be accurate, "
"though it is worth your time practicing. It can put a lot of bullets out in "
"a short time, however, and is an excellent suppression weapon because of "
"it.\n"

#. L_DISH_293
msgid ""
"Maian flexibility in design has produced this submachine gun with an "
"interesting secondary mode - a high-velocity bullet that can penetrate "
"objects easily. The fire rate, as with the Phoenix, is reduced during the "
"secondary mode; this is to prevent damage to the firing mechanism and "
"barrel.\n"
msgstr ""
"Maian flexibility in design has produced this submachine gun with an "
"interesting secondary mode - a high-velocity bullet that can penetrate "
"objects easily. The fire rate, as with the Phoenix, is reduced during the "
"secondary mode; this is to prevent damage to the firing mechanism and "
"barrel.\n"

#. L_DISH_294
msgid ""
"The RC-P120 fires a special mineral bullet that, coupled with a high fire "
"rate and a huge magazine, makes this a perfect tool to be used against the "
"Skedar, should the need arise. The bullets can be used to fuel a prototype "
"Cloaking Device - the training has been altered to reflect this particular "
"characteristic.\n"
msgstr ""
"The RC-P120 fires a special mineral bullet that, coupled with a high fire "
"rate and a huge magazine, makes this a perfect tool to be used against the "
"Skedar, should the need arise. The bullets can be used to fuel a prototype "
"Cloaking Device - the training has been altered to reflect this particular "
"characteristic.\n"

#. L_DISH_295
msgid ""
"Not only can the gun fold up to resemble a laptop PC, but it can be deployed"
" as a sentry gun in secondary mode to cover an escape route or protect a "
"location.\n"
msgstr ""
"Not only can the gun fold up to resemble a laptop PC, but it can be deployed"
" as a sentry gun in secondary mode to cover an escape route or protect a "
"location.\n"

#. L_DISH_296
msgid ""
"This is the model that dataDyne successfully submitted to the U.S. military,"
" though it has yet to be widely adopted. In keeping with the tendency of "
"dataDyne to give people nasty surprises, the basic model assault rifle "
"carries a proximity mine below the barrel. Using the secondary mode rather "
"obviously means you have to throw the weapon away.\n"
msgstr ""
"This is the model that dataDyne successfully submitted to the U.S. military,"
" though it has yet to be widely adopted. In keeping with the tendency of "
"dataDyne to give people nasty surprises, the basic model assault rifle "
"carries a proximity mine below the barrel. Using the secondary mode rather "
"obviously means you have to throw the weapon away.\n"

#. L_DISH_297
msgid ""
"As far as we can ascertain, the secondary mode of the weapon seems to be a "
"threat identifier, targetting mines, hidden explosive devices (such as the "
"Dragon in secondary mode), and automatic guns. Though a powerful gun, the "
"assault rifle's magazine is perhaps too small. \n"
msgstr ""
"As far as we can ascertain, the secondary mode of the weapon seems to be a "
"threat identifier, targetting mines, hidden explosive devices (such as the "
"Dragon in secondary mode), and automatic guns. Though a powerful gun, the "
"assault rifle's magazine is perhaps too small. \n"

#. L_DISH_298
msgid ""
"The Institute's first attempt at a support weapon, the AR34 is a fairly "
"basic assault rifle. The secondary mode is a permanent zoom. Testing is "
"weighted towards accuracy training.\n"
msgstr ""
"The Institute's first attempt at a support weapon, the AR34 is a fairly "
"basic assault rifle. The secondary mode is a permanent zoom. Testing is "
"weighted towards accuracy training.\n"

#. L_DISH_299
msgid ""
"The heavier variant of the Dragon, with the proximity mine removed and "
"replaced by a small grenade launcher. Adopted by the U.S. military as a "
"squad heavy support weapon - it is not hard to see why. Use the tests to get"
" used to the grenade trajectory.\n"
msgstr ""
"The heavier variant of the Dragon, with the proximity mine removed and "
"replaced by a small grenade launcher. Adopted by the U.S. military as a "
"squad heavy support weapon - it is not hard to see why. Use the tests to get"
" used to the grenade trajectory.\n"

#. L_DISH_300
msgid ""
"Subtlety is not an option here. There are two modes, single or double blast."
" The magazine is quite large for a shotgun, but be aware of the long reload "
"times and plan your movements accordingly.\n"
msgstr ""
"Subtlety is not an option here. There are two modes, single or double blast."
" The magazine is quite large for a shotgun, but be aware of the long reload "
"times and plan your movements accordingly.\n"

#. L_DISH_301
msgid ""
"A finely engineered, silenced sniper rifle with a high-powered zoom. The "
"only part of the operation that can interfere with the accuracy of the "
"weapon is the sniper. Make sure you use the secondary mode to crouch down "
"and steady your aim.\n"
msgstr ""
"A finely engineered, silenced sniper rifle with a high-powered zoom. The "
"only part of the operation that can interfere with the accuracy of the "
"weapon is the sniper. Make sure you use the secondary mode to crouch down "
"and steady your aim.\n"

#. L_DISH_302
msgid ""
"Even though the engineering techniques are beyond us, we can still "
"appreciate the effects of the FarSight rifle. The shot is almost "
"unstoppable, and the scope can penetrate walls to a great depth, locking on "
"to targets if need be.\n"
msgstr ""
"Even though the engineering techniques are beyond us, we can still "
"appreciate the effects of the FarSight rifle. The shot is almost "
"unstoppable, and the scope can penetrate walls to a great depth, locking on "
"to targets if need be.\n"

#. L_DISH_303
msgid ""
"The primary function of the crossbow is a nonlethal drugged shot, while the "
"secondary is an instant kill. It is a stealth weapon first and foremost, so "
"the reloading can be time-consuming and inconvenient in a firefight.\n"
msgstr ""
"The primary function of the crossbow is a nonlethal drugged shot, while the "
"secondary is an instant kill. It is a stealth weapon first and foremost, so "
"the reloading can be time-consuming and inconvenient in a firefight.\n"

#. L_DISH_304
msgid ""
"The tranquilizer gun is a common design, found in many medical laboratories "
"and hospitals worldwide. It can be switched from the tranquilizer pellets to"
" a short-range lethal dose, which uses up a lot more of the reservoir of "
"sedative.\n"
msgstr ""
"The tranquilizer gun is a common design, found in many medical laboratories "
"and hospitals worldwide. It can be switched from the tranquilizer pellets to"
" a short-range lethal dose, which uses up a lot more of the reservoir of "
"sedative.\n"

#. L_DISH_305
msgid ""
"Try to control this weapon as best you can. It was designed for a far "
"stronger user than a human, that much is certain. Kneeling down may help "
"steady your aim, but not refine it. If any opponents do make it past the "
"hail of fire, then the barrels can be used as a grinder to inflict damage.\n"
msgstr ""
"Try to control this weapon as best you can. It was designed for a far "
"stronger user than a human, that much is certain. Kneeling down may help "
"steady your aim, but not refine it. If any opponents do make it past the "
"hail of fire, then the barrels can be used as a grinder to inflict damage.\n"

#. L_DISH_306
msgid ""
"A recent dataDyne product, with interesting technology inside it. The "
"secondary mode activates a magnetic field around the bomb, providing "
"adhesion for a limited amount of time. When a certain amount of time has "
"passed, the field is reversed and the bomb falls from the impact point and "
"explodes.\n"
msgstr ""
"A recent dataDyne product, with interesting technology inside it. The "
"secondary mode activates a magnetic field around the bomb, providing "
"adhesion for a limited amount of time. When a certain amount of time has "
"passed, the field is reversed and the bomb falls from the impact point and "
"explodes.\n"

#. L_DISH_307
msgid ""
"A compact, reuseable missile launcher - reloads after each shot. The "
"secondary mode uses a variant of the lock-on system from the CMP150 "
"submachine gun, with a single designated target. The missile travels at a "
"slower speed as it tracks the target, so plan for this and time your shots "
"carefully.\n"
msgstr ""
"A compact, reuseable missile launcher - reloads after each shot. The "
"secondary mode uses a variant of the lock-on system from the CMP150 "
"submachine gun, with a single designated target. The missile travels at a "
"slower speed as it tracks the target, so plan for this and time your shots "
"carefully.\n"

#. L_DISH_308
msgid ""
"This Skedar handheld missile launcher can fire either an unguided rocket or "
"a user-controlled remote rocket. Presumably this gave the Skedar some "
"perverse satisfaction when the warhead camera closed on the target, but a "
"Carrington Institute agent is beyond such things. The guided rocket speeds "
"up automatically, but can be slowed down for greater maneuverability. "
"Detonation occurs on contact or when the trigger is pressed.\n"
msgstr ""
"This Skedar handheld missile launcher can fire either an unguided rocket or "
"a user-controlled remote rocket. Presumably this gave the Skedar some "
"perverse satisfaction when the warhead camera closed on the target, but a "
"Carrington Institute agent is beyond such things. The guided rocket speeds "
"up automatically, but can be slowed down for greater maneuverability. "
"Detonation occurs on contact or when the trigger is pressed.\n"

#. L_DISH_309
msgid ""
"A finely tempered fighting knife, which is also balanced for throwing. "
"Practice is essential to get accustomed to the range and trajectory of the "
"thrown blade.\n"
msgstr ""
"A finely tempered fighting knife, which is also balanced for throwing. "
"Practice is essential to get accustomed to the range and trajectory of the "
"thrown blade.\n"

#. L_DISH_310
msgid ""
"The experimental weapons department has come up with a small but effective "
"wrist-mounted laser with two beam settings. The primary mode fires a blast "
"out to a considerable range, while the secondary mode provides a continual "
"beam for as long as the trigger is pressed.\n"
msgstr ""
"The experimental weapons department has come up with a small but effective "
"wrist-mounted laser with two beam settings. The primary mode fires a blast "
"out to a considerable range, while the secondary mode provides a continual "
"beam for as long as the trigger is pressed.\n"

#. L_DISH_311
msgid ""
"The fragmentation anti-personnel grenade has four seconds from activation to"
" detonation on the basic fuse. For your entertainment and delight, we have "
"included a secondary mode - proximity pinball. The grenade will bounce "
"around until the charge wears off or the proximity detector is triggered.\n"
msgstr ""
"The fragmentation anti-personnel grenade has four seconds from activation to"
" detonation on the basic fuse. For your entertainment and delight, we have "
"included a secondary mode - proximity pinball. The grenade will bounce "
"around until the charge wears off or the proximity detector is triggered.\n"

#. L_DISH_312
msgid ""
"This Maian grenade plays havoc with the neurons in sentient creatures. If "
"you wander into the blast radius, your vision will blur and you will lose "
"your grip on whatever you're holding. The grenade can be set to go off on "
"impact or by proximity trigger. Make sure you throw it far enough away.\n"
msgstr ""
"This Maian grenade plays havoc with the neurons in sentient creatures. If "
"you wander into the blast radius, your vision will blur and you will lose "
"your grip on whatever you're holding. The grenade can be set to go off on "
"impact or by proximity trigger. Make sure you throw it far enough away.\n"

#. L_DISH_313
msgid ""
"A degree of judgement is required for the effective use of timed mines, "
"otherwise the intended target may overrun the explosion range and come after"
" you. Hone your skills in the tests before you make a critical error in the "
"field. The secondary function is a threat detector identical to that found "
"on the K7 Avenger assault rifle.\n"
msgstr ""
"A degree of judgement is required for the effective use of timed mines, "
"otherwise the intended target may overrun the explosion range and come after"
" you. Hone your skills in the tests before you make a critical error in the "
"field. The secondary function is a threat detector identical to that found "
"on the K7 Avenger assault rifle.\n"

#. L_DISH_314
msgid ""
"The key to successful placement of proximity mines is to put them where your"
" opponent doesn't expect to encounter them. If you find yourself on the "
"receiving end of proximity mines, use the threat detector secondary mode to "
"make sure of your surroundings. It may be wasting your time, but if it "
"isn't, it could save your life.\n"
msgstr ""
"The key to successful placement of proximity mines is to put them where your"
" opponent doesn't expect to encounter them. If you find yourself on the "
"receiving end of proximity mines, use the threat detector secondary mode to "
"make sure of your surroundings. It may be wasting your time, but if it "
"isn't, it could save your life.\n"

#. L_DISH_315
msgid ""
"The latest variety of remote detonated mines, essentially the same as all "
"that have gone before. The primary mode is placing the mines, while the "
"secondary mode is giving the detonation command. If you can't see the mine, "
"you'll have to rely on old-fashioned guesswork and timing. \n"
msgstr ""
"The latest variety of remote detonated mines, essentially the same as all "
"that have gone before. The primary mode is placing the mines, while the "
"secondary mode is giving the detonation command. If you can't see the mine, "
"you'll have to rely on old-fashioned guesswork and timing. \n"

#. L_DISH_316
msgid "Holo 1 - Looking Around\n"
msgstr "Holo 1 - Looking Around\n"

